# Product

Portfolio side project. The live URL and the source are both the resume.

- One transaction hash in, a narrative out. Public, read-only, shareable.
- V1: Ethereum mainnet, one hash, one page.
- No wallets, signing, accounts, saved history, or write path.
- Not an explorer, token tracker, mint page, DEX, or protocol console.
- If the answer needs a second page of tables, the page failed.
- A stranger on a phone should get it in 30 seconds.
